                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为了加强师德师风建设，更好推进学校教育教学工作，绍兴一中近期通过举办系列讲座等形式开展教师师德师风培训。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">
</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;"><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">意识形态讲座</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161326119160.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161326119160.png" /><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">6<span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">30</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日下午，正值</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">七</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">•</span><span style="font-family:宋体">一</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">建党一百周年前夕，为加强意识形态领域学习教育，提升教师政治素养，我校邀请绍兴市直机关工委常务副书记黄伟英同志为全体教职工作《重视和加强党的意识形态工作》的主题讲座。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161326392944.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161326392944.png" /><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">黄伟英同志从</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">“<span style="font-family:宋体">意识形态工作的地位作用</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">意识形态领域面临的情况</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">意识形态工作的基本要求</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">三个方面，深入浅出地阐述如何重视和加强党的意识形态工作。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">她指出意识形态工作是党的一项极端重要的工作，事关党的前途命运、国家长治久安、民族凝聚力和向心力。然而当前意识形态领域面对的形势依然错综复杂，面临的风险挑战依然严峻，意识形态斗争和较量有时十分尖锐。做好意识形态工作，关键在党，关键在党的各级组织。需要坚持和加强党对意识形态工作的全面领导，不断加强意识形态领域主导权和话语权。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">本次专题讲座，既有理论深度，又有实践意义，对于如何做好新形势下意识形态工作具有很好的指导和启发。通过此次讲座学习，广大教职工进一步了解意识形态工作的重要性、紧迫性，深刻认识到意识形态领域存在的问题短板，明白做好意识形态工作需要树牢</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">四个意识</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，坚定</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">四个自信</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，做到</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">两个维护</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，在意识形态斗争中做到对党忠诚、个人干净、敢于担当。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">
</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">师德师风培训</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161327567116.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161327567116.JPG" /><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为进一步落实上级文件，加强和改进我校师德师风建设，促进教师综合素质的提升，</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">7</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日，师德师风培训会暨教工大会在图书馆三楼报告厅举行。本次会议由校党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮主持，全体教工参加。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">01</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">荣休仪式</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161329236465.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161329236465.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(33,32,32);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">会议伊始，绍兴一中为</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2021</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年退休物理教师张小娟举行荣休仪式。榜样在身边，润物细无声。张小娟数十年如一日地践行着立德树人的庄严承诺，把自己的职业生涯奉献给了她热爱的一中教育事业。校党委书记、校长王琛为她颁发退休证、纪念册。在热烈的掌声中，大家为张小娟献上鲜花和祝福。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161329573452.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161329573452.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(33,32,32);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">张小娟深情回忆了难忘的工作岁月和幸福点滴，对学校的关心表示感谢，希望一中越来越好。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(33,32,32);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">孙洪亮代表学校向张小娟致以崇高的敬意和衷心的感谢，他指出，学校各项发展都离不开老师们的奉献，学校的每一份成就，都渗透着老师们的智慧和汗水。他同时祝愿张小娟老师退休后生活幸福，身体健康。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">02</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">劳模宣讲</span></span></strong></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161331048006.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161331048006.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">本次师德培训邀请全国劳动模范、全国五一劳动奖章获得者、浙江省优秀共产党员、绍兴市总工会挂职副主席何贝来校宣讲，他从个人经历、感悟入手讲述</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">汗水铸就梦想 劳动创造幸福</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">的奋斗情怀。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/dw/2021/8/202108161331407609.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202108161331407609.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px">“<span style="font-family:宋体">你在意的东西，一定要努力去争取，哪怕结果不如愿，至少不会存遗憾</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”“</span><span style="font-family:宋体">每一个岗位，都是一次锻炼</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">”</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，在题为</span></span><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">《做一根拉长的橡皮筋》</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">宣讲中，何贝用质朴的语言与全体教工分享了自己从一名普通供电所工人成长为全国劳模的故事，他简单平凡的话语，传递了爱岗敬业的劳动奉献精神，深刻感染了全体教工。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:28px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph"><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">师德</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">——</span><span style="font-family:宋体">师爱为魂，学高为师，身正为范</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">;</span><span style="font-family:宋体">师风</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">——</span><span style="font-family:宋体">师诚为魄，品高为师，行为示范。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13px"><span style="font-family:宋体">全体教师牢记于意识形态教育，感动于身边的榜样力量，钦佩于劳模的奋斗情怀，在往后的工作中，将更加坚定地把立德树人作为教育的根本任务，为社会培养德智体美全面发展的社会主义建设者和接班人。</span></span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
